context_title:
---

Build a complete, production-ready, browser-based online IDE platform delivered as a single `index.html` file. The file must contain all HTML, all CSS (including every inline style block), all JavaScript logic, all subpage views (rendered as SPA routes), and all third-party library integrations loaded from CDN. No external files, no build steps, no placeholders, no mock data, no simplified stubs. Every feature described below must be fully implemented and functional.

---

## 1. Document Structure & Bootstrap

Construct the HTML5 document with the following root element:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="ui-theme-root notranslate" translate="no" style="-webkit-user-select: none;">
```

The `<html>` element must carry:
- `lang="en"` for internationalization
- `class="ui-theme-root notranslate"` — `ui-theme-root` is the CSS custom property namespace anchor for the entire design token system; `notranslate` prevents browser translation services from altering code content
- `translate="no"` as a secondary machine-translation suppression directive
- `style="-webkit-user-select: none;"` to enforce app-like selection behavior at the root level

The `<body>` element must apply a dark-mode class on initial load using an inline script placed as the first child of `<body>`:

```html
<script>(function(){try{if(window.matchMedia("(prefers-color-scheme:dark)").matches){document.body.classList.add("theme-dark")}}catch(e){}})()</script>
```

The SPA mount point is `<div id="root"></div>` inside `<body>`. All application UI is rendered into this element by the JavaScript runtime.

---

## 2. Critical Rendering Path: Inline Styles

All styles must be inlined in `<style>` blocks inside `<head>` to prevent Flash of Unstyled Content (FOUC). No external CSS files are permitted. The inline styles must cover the following subsystems in full:

### 2.1 Design Token System

Define all CSS custom properties on the `.ui-theme-root` selector. The token categories and their required variables are:

**Color tokens (foreground):**
- `--foreground-default` — primary text color
- `--foreground-dimmer` — secondary/muted text
- `--foreground-dimmest` — tertiary/placeholder text

**Color tokens (background):**
- `--background-root` — page background
- `--background-default` — panel/surface background
- `--background-higher` — elevated surface (cards, modals, tooltips)
- `--background-highest` — highest elevation surface (selected items in dropdowns)
- `--background-overlay` — overlay/panel background

**Color tokens (accent):**
- `--accent-primary-default`, `--accent-primary-dimmer`, `--accent-primary-dimmest`, `--accent-primary-stronger`
- `--accent-blue-default`, `--accent-blue-stronger`, `--accent-blue-strongest`
- `--accent-green-default`, `--accent-green-stronger`, `--accent-green-dimmer`
- `--accent-red-default`, `--accent-red-stronger`
- `--accent-orange-default`, `--accent-orange-dimmer`, `--accent-orange-strongest`
- `--accent-yellow-strongest`
- `--accent-lime-strongest`
- `--accent-teal-strongest`
- `--accent-purple-stronger`
- `--accent-pink-stronger`
- `--accent-negative-default`

**Color tokens (interactive/outline):**
- `--interactive-background`, `--interactive-background--active`
- `--interactive-border`, `--interactive-border--hover`
- `--outline-dimmest`, `--outline-dimmer`, `--outline-default`
- `--surface-color`
- `--white`

**Typography tokens:**
- `--font-family-default` — UI font stack (IBM Plex Sans, ABC Diatype, system-ui, sans-serif)
- `--font-family-code` — monospace font stack (ReplitHack, Hack, monospace)
- `--font-size-default` — 14px
- `--font-size-small` — 12px
- `--font-size-subhead-default` — 13px
- `--font-weight-bold` — 600
- `--line-height-small` — 1.4

**Spacing tokens:** `--space-2`, `--space-4`, `--space-6`, `--space-8`, `--space-32` (values: 2px, 4px, 6px, 8px, 32px)

**Border radius tokens:** `--border-radius-4` (4px), `--border-radius-12` (12px), `--border-radius-default` (6px)

**Shadow tokens:** `--shadow-1`, `--shadow-default`

**Motion tokens:** `--transition-duration-snappy` (150ms), `--transition-timing-function-snappy` (cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1))

Define two complete theme variants by toggling a class on `<body>`:
- `.theme-light` on `.ui-theme-root` — light palette values for all tokens above
- `.theme-dark` on `.ui-theme-root` — dark palette values for all tokens above

### 2.2 CodeMirror 6 Editor Styles

Inline the complete CodeMirror 6 base stylesheet. Use the obfuscated class prefix convention `.cm-` for functional classes and define the following theme container classes:

- `.editor-base` — base editor container: `position: relative; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column;`
- `.editor-light` — light theme wrapper
- `.editor-dark` — dark theme wrapper

Implement the full set of CodeMirror 6 structural CSS rules for:

**Scroller & Content:**
```css
.editor-base .cm-scroller {
  display: flex; align-items: flex-start; font-family: monospace;
  line-height: 1.4; height: 100%; overflow-x: auto;
  position: relative; z-index: 0; overflow-anchor: none;
}
.editor-base .cm-content {
  margin: 0; flex-grow: 2; flex-shrink: 0; display: block;
  white-space: pre; word-wrap: normal; box-sizing: border-box;
  min-height: 100%; padding: 4px 0; outline: none;
}
.editor-base .cm-content[contenteditable=true] { -webkit-user-modify: read-write-plaintext-only; }
.editor-base .cm-lineWrapping {
  white-space: pre-wrap; white-space: break-spaces;
  word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; flex-shrink: 1;
}
```

**Lines:**
```css
.editor-base .cm-line { display: block; padding: 0 2px 0 6px; position: relative; line-height: var(--line-height-small); }
```

**Layers:**
```css
.editor-base .cm-layer > * { position: absolute; }
.editor-base .cm-layer { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; contain: size style; }
```

**Cursor:**
```css
.editor-base .cm-cursorLayer { pointer-events: none; }
.editor-base.cm-focused > .cm-scroller > .cm-cursorLayer { animation: steps(1) cm-blink 1.2s infinite; }
@keyframes cm-blink { 50% { opacity: 0; } }
@keyframes cm-blink2 { 50% { opacity: 0; } }
.editor-base .cm-cursor, .editor-base .cm-dropCursor {
  border-left: 1.2px solid black; margin-left: -0.6px; pointer-events: none;
}
.editor-base .cm-cursor { display: none; }
.editor-base.cm-focused > .cm-scroller > .cm-cursorLayer .cm-cursor { display: block; }
.editor-base .cm-dropCursor { position: absolute; }
```

**Selection (light/dark variants):**
```css
.editor-light .cm-selectionBackground { background: #d9d9d9; }
.editor-dark .cm-selectionBackground { background: #222; }
.editor-light.cm-focused > .cm-scroller > .cm-selectionLayer .cm-selectionBackground { background: #d7d4f0; }
.editor-dark.cm-focused > .cm-scroller > .cm-selectionLayer .cm-selectionBackground { background: #233; }
```

**Active line:**
```css
.editor-light .cm-activeLine { background-color: #cceeff44; }
.editor-dark .cm-activeLine { background-color: #99eeff33; }
```

**Gutters:**
```css
.editor-base .cm-gutters {
  flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; height: 100%;
  box-sizing: border-box; inset-inline-start: 0; z-index: 200;
}
.editor-light .cm-gutters { background-color: #f5f5f5; color: #6c6c6c; border-right: 1px solid #ddd; }
.editor-dark .cm-gutters { background-color: #333338; color: #ccc; }
.editor-base .cm-gutter {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-shrink: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box; min-height: 100%; overflow: hidden;
}
.editor-base .cm-gutterElement { box-sizing: border-box; }
.editor-base .cm-lineNumbers .cm-gutterElement {
  padding: 0 3px 0 5px; min-width: 20px; text-align: right; white-space: nowrap;
}
.editor-light .cm-activeLineGutter { background-color: #e2f2ff; }
.editor-dark .cm-activeLineGutter { background-color: #222227; }
```

**Panels:**
```css
.editor-base .cm-panels {
  box-sizing: border-box; position: sticky; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 300;
}
.editor-light .cm-panels { background-color: #f5f5f5; color: black; }
.editor-light .cm-panels-top { border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; }
.editor-light .cm-panels-bottom { border-top: 1px solid #ddd; }
.editor-dark .cm-panels { background-color: #333338; color: white; }
```

**Tooltips & Autocomplete:**
```css
.editor-base .cm-tooltip { z-index: 100; box-sizing: border-box; }
.editor-light .cm-tooltip { border: 1px solid #bbb; background-color: #f5f5f5; }
.editor-dark .cm-tooltip { background-color: #333338; color: white; }
.editor-base .cm-tooltip.cm-tooltip-autocomplete > ul {
  font-family: monospace; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden auto;
  max-width: min(700px, 95vw); min-width: 250px; max-height: 10em;
  list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0;
}
.editor-base .cm-tooltip.cm-tooltip-autocomplete > ul > li {
  overflow-x: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; cursor: pointer;
  padding: 1px 3px; line-height: 1.2;
}
.editor-light .cm-tooltip-autocomplete ul li[aria-selected] { background: #17c; color: white; }
.editor-dark .cm-tooltip-autocomplete ul li[aria-selected] { background: #347; color: white; }
.editor-base .cm-completionInfo {
  position: absolute; padding: 3px 9px; width: max-content;
  max-width: 400px; box-sizing: border-box; white-space: pre-line;
}
.editor-base .cm-completionInfo.cm-completionInfo-left { right: 100%; }
.editor-base .cm-completionInfo.cm-completionInfo-right { left: 100%; }
```

**Search panel:**
```css
.editor-base .cm-panel.cm-search { padding: 2px 6px 4px; position: relative; }
.editor-base .cm-panel.cm-search [name=close] {
  position: absolute; top: 0; right: 4px; background-color: inherit;
  border: none; font: inherit; padding: 0; margin: 0;
}
.editor-light .cm-searchMatch { background-color: #ffff0054; }
.editor-dark .cm-searchMatch { background-color: #00ffff8a; }
.editor-light .cm-searchMatch-selected { background-color: #ff6a0054; }
.editor-dark .cm-searchMatch-selected { background-color: #ff00ff8a; }
```

**Bracket matching:**
```css
.editor-base.cm-focused .cm-matchingBracket { background-color: #328c8252; }
.editor-base.cm-focused .cm-nonmatchingBracket { background-color: #bb555544; }
.editor-base .cm-selectionMatch { background-color: #99ff7780; }
```

**Fold markers:**
```css
.editor-base .cm-foldPlaceholder {
  background-color: #eee; border: 1px solid #ddd; color: #888;
  border-radius: .2em; margin: 0 1px; padding: 0 1px; cursor: pointer;
}
.editor-base .cm-foldGutter span { padding: 0 1px; cursor: pointer; }
```

**Completion icons:**
```css
.editor-base .cm-completionIcon { font-size: 90%; width: .8em; display: inline-block; text-align: center; padding-right: .6em; opacity: 0.6; box-sizing: content-box; }
.editor-base .cm-completionIcon-function:after, .editor-base .cm-completionIcon-method:after { content: 'ƒ'; }
.editor-base .cm-completionIcon-class:after { content: '○'; }
.editor-base .cm-completionIcon-variable:after { content: '𝑥'; }
.editor-base .cm-completionIcon-keyword:after { content: '🔑︎'; }
```

**Ghost text (AI inline suggestions):**
```css
.editor-base .cm-ghost-text { opacity: 0.675; filter: grayscale(0.325); }
.editor-base .cm-limbo-text {
  display: inline-block; opacity: 0.85;
  background-color: rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.1); text-decoration: line-through;
}
.editor-base .cm-ghost-marker { opacity: 0.5; }
```

**Inline diff (version control):**
```css
.editor-base .cm-inline-diff-line-deletion { background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(180,0,0,0.075), rgba(180,0,0,0.075)); cursor: text; }
.editor-base .cm-inline-diff-line-insertion { background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(0,180,0,0.075), rgba(0,180,0,0.075)); }
.editor-base .cm-inline-diff-text-insertion { display: inline-block; background: rgba(0,180,0,0.125); }
.editor-base .cm-inline-diff-text-deletion { display: inline-block; background: rgba(180,0,0,0.125); }
```

**Multiplayer cursors and selections:**
```css
.editor-base .cm-multiplayer-selection-green { background: rgba(27,196,125,0.2); }
.editor-base .cm-multiplayer-selection-red { background: rgba(239,85,51,0.2); }
.editor-base .cm-multiplayer-selection-blue { background: rgba(24,160,251,0.2); }
.editor-base .cm-multiplayer-selection-purple { background: rgba(144,124,255,0.2); }
.editor-base .cm-multiplayer-selection-teal { background: rgba(0,181,206,0.2); }
.editor-base .cm-multiplayer-selection-pink { background: rgba(238,70,211,0.2); }
.editor-base .multiplayer-cursor { width: 2px; left: 0; top: 0; }
.editor-base .multiplayer-cursor .multiplayer-label {
  border-radius: var(--border-radius-4); padding: 1px; position: absolute;
  left: 0px; animation: fadeOut 2s ease-in forwards; color: white;
  display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap;
}
.editor-base .multiplayer-cursor:hover .multiplayer-label { animation: auto; }
@keyframes fadeOut { 0% { opacity: 1; } 100% { opacity: 0; } }
```

**Replit-specific theme overrides (applied via `.editor-themed` class on the editor root):**
```css
.editor-themed.cm-focused { outline: 0 none; }
.editor-themed { color: var(--foreground-default); }
.editor-themed .cm-editor { background-color: var(--surface-color); }
.editor-themed .cm-content { font-family: var(--font-family-code); }
.editor-themed .cm-line { position: relative; line-height: var(--line-height-small); }
.editor-themed .cm-scroller { overflow: auto; font-family: var(--font-family-code); }
.editor-themed .cm-gutters {
  background-color: var(--surface-color); color: var(--foreground-dimmest);
  border: none; min-width: fit-content; display: flex;
  justify-content: flex-end; user-select: none;
}
.editor-themed .cm-selectionBackground { background: var(--accent-primary-dimmest) !important; min-width: 0.325ch; }
.editor-themed .cm-cursor, .editor-themed .cm-dropCursor {
  border-left-color: var(--accent-primary-default);
  border-left-width: 2px; border-radius: 2px;
}
.editor-themed .cm-placeholder { color: var(--foreground-dimmer); display: inline-block; }
.editor-themed .cm-foldPlaceholder {
  padding: 0 var(--space-4); border-radius: var(--border-radius-4);
  background-color: var(--background-root); border: none; color: var(--foreground-dimmer);
}
.editor-themed .cm-selectionMatch { background-color: var(--outline-dimmest); }
.editor-themed .cm-panels {
  background-color: var(--background-overlay);
  font-size: var(--font-size-subhead-default); color: var(--foreground-default);
}
.editor-themed .cm-panels-bottom { border-top: 1px solid var(--background-higher); max-height: 30%; }
.editor-themed .cm-searchMatch { background-color: var(--accent-primary-dimmest); }
.editor-themed .cm-searchMatch-selected { background-color: var(--accent-primary-default); }
.editor-themed .cm-tooltip {
  width: max-content; max-width: 100%; box-shadow: var(--shadow-1);
  border-radius: var(--border-radius-4); border: 1px solid var(--outline-dimmer); overflow: hidden;
}
.editor-themed .cm-tooltip-autocomplete > ul {
  background-color: var(--background-higher);
  border-radius: calc(var(--border-radius-4) - 1px);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-default);
}
.editor-themed .cm-tooltip-autocomplete > ul > li:hover { background-color: var(--accent-primary-dimmest); }
.editor-themed .cm-tooltip-autocomplete > ul > li[aria-selected] {
  background-color: var(--accent-primary-dimmer); color: var(--white);
}
.editor-themed .cm-tooltip-autocomplete { overflow: visible; min-width: 260px; max-width: min(430px, 95vw); }
.editor-themed .cm-tooltip.cm-completionInfo {
  background-color: var(--background-higher); box-shadow: var(--shadow-1);
  border-radius: var(--border-radius-4); padding: 0 !important;
  border-color: transparent; max-height: min(300px, 70vh);
  max-width: min(470px, 80vw) !important; width: 100%; overflow: auto; top: 0 !important;
}
.editor-themed .cm-tooltip-lint { background-color: var(--background-higher); }
```

**Syntax highlighting token classes** (map to design tokens):
```css
.token-comment { color: var(--foreground-dimmest); }
.token-keyword { color: var(--accent-blue-strongest); }
.token-string { color: var(--accent-green-default); }
.token-number { color: var(--accent-orange-strongest); }
.token-operator { color: var(--accent-yellow-strongest); }
.token-function { color: var(--accent-blue-stronger); }
.token-variable { color: var(--foreground-default); }
.token-type { color: var(--accent-purple-stronger); }
.token-constant { color: var(--accent-teal-strongest); }
.token-property { color: var(--accent-blue-stronger); }
.token-tag { color: var(--accent-red-stronger); }
.token-attribute { color: var(--accent-orange-strongest); }
.token-invalid { text-decoration: underline wavy var(--accent-negative-default); }
```

**Print media query:**
```css
@media print { .editor-base .cm-announced { display: none; } }
```

### 2.3 Font Declarations

Declare all fonts inline using `@font-face` rules. The required font families are:

- **IBM Plex Sans** — weights 400, 500, 600 (regular, italic, medium, medium-italic, semibold, semibold-italic) — use CDN URLs from `fonts.gstatic.com` or `fonts.googleapis.com`
- **Hack** (as `EditorHack`) — weights 400 (regular, italic) and 700 (bold, bold-italic) — use CDN URLs
- A custom icon font `platform-icons` — declare with `font-family: 'platform-icons'` using a CDN-hosted woff/ttf source

### 2.4 Application Layout CSS

Define the full application shell layout inline:

```css
*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
html, body, #root { width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: hidden; }
body { font-family: var(--font-family-default); font-size: var(--font-size-default); color: var(--foreground-default); background-color: var(--background-root); }

.app-layout { display: grid; width: 100vw; height: 100vh; grid-template-rows: var(--header-height, 48px) 1fr; grid-template-columns: var(--sidebar-width, 0px) 1fr; transition: grid-template-columns 150ms ease; }
.app-header { grid-column: 1 / -1; grid-row: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 var(--space-8); background-color: var(--background-default); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--outline-dimmest); z-index: 1000; }
.app-sidebar { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 2; background-color: var(--background-default); border-right: 1px solid var(--outline-dimmest); overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.app-main { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 2; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; position: relative; }

.pane-container { display: flex; width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: hidden; }
.pane { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; min-width: 0; }
.pane-divider { width: 4px; background-color: var(--outline-dimmest); cursor: col-resize; flex-shrink: 0; transition: background-color 150ms; }
.pane-divider:hover, .pane-divider.dragging { background-color: var(--accent-primary-default); }

.tab-bar { display: flex; align-items: center; background-color: var(--background-default); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--outline-dimmest); overflow-x: auto; flex-shrink: 0; height: 36px; }
.tab { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-4); padding: 0 var(--space-8); height: 100%; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; font-size: var(--font-size-small); color: var(--foreground-dimmer); border-right: 1px solid var(--outline-dimmest); transition: background-color 150ms; user-select: none; }
.tab:hover { background-color: var(--interactive-background); }
.tab.active { color: var(--foreground-default); background-color: var(--background-higher); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent-primary-default); }
.tab .tab-close { opacity: 0; width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 10px; }
.tab:hover .tab-close, .tab.active .tab-close { opacity: 1; }
.tab .tab-close:hover { background-color: var(--interactive-background--active); }

.editor-pane { flex: 1; overflow: hidden; position: relative; }
.terminal-pane { height: 240px; flex-shrink: 0; background-color: #1a1a1a; border-top: 1px solid var(--outline-dimmest); display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.terminal-header { display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 var(--space-8); height: 32px; background-color: var(--background-default); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--outline-dimmest); font-size: var(--font-size-small); color: var(--foreground-dimmer); }
.terminal-body { flex: 1; overflow: hidden; }

.file-tree { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: var(--space-4) 0; }
.file-tree-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-4); padding: 2px var(--space-8); cursor: pointer; font-size: var(--font-size-small); color: var(--foreground-default); user-select: none; }
.file-tree-item:hover { background-color: var(--interactive-background); }
.file-tree-item.selected { background-color: var(--accent-primary-dimmest); }
.file-tree-item .indent { display: inline-block; }
.file-tree-item .icon { width: 16px; height: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; }

.status-bar { height: 22px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 var(--space-8); background-color: var(--accent-primary-default); color: var(--white); font-size: 11px; gap: var(--space-8); flex-shrink: 0; }
.status-bar-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); cursor: pointer; padding: 0 var(--space-4); border-radius: var(--border-radius-4); }
.status-bar-item:hover { background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); }

.modal-overlay { position: fixed; inset: 0; background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.5); z-index: 99000; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
.modal { background-color: var(--background-higher); border: 1px solid var(--outline-dimmest); border-radius: var(--border-radius-12); box-shadow: var(--shadow-1); padding: var(--space-32); min-width: 400px; max-width: 90vw; }
.modal-header { font-size: 18px; font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold); margin-bottom: var(--space-8); color: var(--foreground-default); }

.btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: var(--space-4); padding: 6px var(--space-8); border-radius: var(--border-radius-4); font-size: var(--font-size-small); font-family: var(--font-family-default); cursor: pointer; border: none; transition: background-color 120ms, box-shadow 120ms; font-weight: 500; }
.btn-primary { background-color: var(--accent-primary-default); color: var(--white); }
.btn-primary:hover { background-color: var(--accent-primary-stronger); }
.btn-secondary { background-color: var(--interactive-background); color: var(--foreground-default); border: 1px solid var(--outline-dimmest); }
.btn-secondary:hover { background-color: var(--interactive-background--active); }
.btn:focus-visible { box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--accent-primary-default); outline: 2px solid transparent; outline-offset: 4px; }

.input { width: 100%; padding: 6px var(--space-8); border: 1px solid var(--outline-dimmest); border-radius: var(--border-radius-4); background-color: var(--surface-color); color: var(--foreground-default); font-size: var(--font-size-default); font-family: var(--font-family-default); transition: box-shadow 120ms; }
.input:focus { outline: none; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--accent-primary-default); border-color: transparent; }

